{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>לבוז</b> Two times in the Masorah: פן נהיה לבוז. ונעוה לב יהיה לבוז. Because he caused his father's heart to taunt, saying \"Recognize, please — is this your son's garment?\", it became לבוז, for she said to him \"Recognize, please — whose seal is this?\""], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 38, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:58.098664964Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}